=== BATCH SCREENING TASK ===
Review: Desmopressin use for minimising perioperative blood transfusion
Total studies to screen: 25

SELECTION CRITERIA:
We included randomised controlled trials comparing DDAVP to placebo or an active comparator (e.g. tranexamic acid, 
aprotinin) before, during, or immediately after surgery or after invasive procedures in adults or children.

